1.0.2 (2026-06-08)
------------------
- Fix: patch LegaOnline WSDL at load time to declare missing xmlns:s namespace.
  LegaOnline's WSDL uses s:string/s:int/s:boolean but omits xmlns:s declaration,
  causing zeep to raise XMLParseError. The fix injects
  xmlns:s="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" on the root definitions element.
